### student deatails
GET http://localhost:5000/student-api/student


### get the student by id
GET http://localhost:5000/student-api/student/9

### update student details
PUT http://localhost:5000/student-api/student/11
Content-Type: application/json

{

    "CGPA": 9,
    "Branch": "DS",
    "Backlogs": 0,
    "Skills": [
        { "name": "python", "level": "Intermediate" },
        { "name": "ML", "level": "Beginner" },
        { "name":" Java","level":"Beginner"}
    ]

}

